"Hub resolves `platform` from input or `formatSapPlatform(app_id, "
"instance_id)` → `sap:{app_slug}:{instance_id}` (e.g. "
"`sap:pairprogramming:k7m`). Writes into conversation `platform_extra`:"
msgstr ""
"Hub 从输入或 `formatSapPlatform(app_id, instance_id)` 解析 `platform` → `sap:"
"{app_slug}:{instance_id}`（例如 `sap:pairprogramming:k7m`）。写入对话的 "
"`platform_extra`："

